WEBVTT

00:00:38.746 --> 00:00:42.746
www.titlovi.com

00:00:45.746 --> 00:00:47.714
This is the right
direction, isn't it?

00:00:50.684 --> 00:00:53.354
Paradise is somewhere
ahead, right?

00:00:53.354 --> 00:00:55.288
Yes. It is.

00:00:57.925 --> 00:00:59.017
Are you in pain?

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:03.861
It's strange...

00:01:04.865 --> 00:01:07.959
Somewhere along the line,
I started believing in all of it.

00:01:09.503 --> 00:01:12.370
Everything about you.
The wolves.

00:01:13.074 --> 00:01:14.336
And Paradise.

00:01:15.242 --> 00:01:20.009
I feel like I'm seeing the world clearly
for the first time just as it's about to end.

00:01:20.881 --> 00:01:22.405
It's a bit
too late, huh?

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:24.408
It will not end.

00:01:24.819 --> 00:01:27.344
It is so that it can
begin once again.

00:01:28.856 --> 00:01:31.984
So that it can be
born once again.

00:03:45.326 --> 00:03:46.759
Pops...

00:03:49.663 --> 00:03:52.154
It was all a
misunderstanding.

00:03:52.566 --> 00:03:57.868
Wolves didn't attack
Ruus, Mom, or Kyrios.

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:01.267
Jaguara was behind it.

00:04:03.811 --> 00:04:05.278
Talk about ironic.

00:04:10.918 --> 00:04:11.680
Pops!

00:04:12.086 --> 00:04:12.984
Pops!

00:04:13.454 --> 00:04:15.718
Hey, pull over!
Something's wrong with the old man!

00:04:16.223 --> 00:04:17.053
Hey!

00:04:23.731 --> 00:04:25.164
Hey, hang in there!

00:04:30.537 --> 00:04:31.538
What's wrong?

00:04:31.538 --> 00:04:33.438
He might be in shock
from dehydration.

00:04:34.108 --> 00:04:36.474
Either that, or he might be
bleeding internally.

00:04:37.378 --> 00:04:38.470
What should we do?

00:04:39.113 --> 00:04:40.740
I don't really
know, either!

00:04:41.248 --> 00:04:43.216
I don't have CPR
certification!

00:05:09.276 --> 00:05:10.243
Cheza...

00:05:29.263 --> 00:05:31.128
Looks like we
got him back...

00:05:59.927 --> 00:06:01.986
Are you all right,
Cheza?

00:06:02.696 --> 00:06:06.132
This one is tired, that is all.
This one is fine.

00:06:06.567 --> 00:06:09.127
Thanks, Cheza.
You've done enough.

00:06:09.670 --> 00:06:11.405
It looks like he's
resting easy now.

00:06:11.405 --> 00:06:14.135
Yeah. I'm pretty sure
he'll come around soon.

00:06:14.875 --> 00:06:19.642
If he finds out that we're around,
won't he just pass out again?

00:06:22.716 --> 00:06:28.889
Heading to Paradise with us like this
would probably drive him crazy.

00:06:28.889 --> 00:06:30.254
That's not true.

00:06:32.159 --> 00:06:36.357
Pops accepted me.

00:06:37.231 --> 00:06:42.294
Even after he learned I was a wolf,
he protected me all the same.

00:06:42.870 --> 00:06:47.830
Oh, so it was a simple misunderstanding
that almost got us killed.

00:06:48.275 --> 00:06:52.302
It may have been a misunderstanding,
but it was all he had to hold on to.

00:06:53.213 --> 00:06:54.305
Hige...

00:06:55.249 --> 00:07:00.312
It seems to me like it was his hatred
of wolves that kept him going.

00:07:24.011 --> 00:07:25.603
I was just touching him
a little.

00:07:26.146 --> 00:07:27.807
His body isn't
all that cold now.

00:07:29.650 --> 00:07:32.210
He won't try
to kill us.

00:07:33.654 --> 00:07:36.646
When he was passed out
up in the mountains a while ago,

00:07:37.191 --> 00:07:42.288
he reached out and held me tight,
mistaking me for you.

00:07:44.264 --> 00:07:47.495
When he did, I thought to myself,
"Blue must really mean a lot to him."

00:07:48.869 --> 00:07:51.838
I was jealous.
Just a little bit.

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:54.000
Toboe.

00:07:55.108 --> 00:08:00.814
If anything ever happens to me,
will you look after Pops for me?

00:08:00.814 --> 00:08:04.306
What do you mean, "If anything happens?"
Don't say stuff like that.

00:08:05.118 --> 00:08:07.609
We're all gonna go
to Paradise <i>together.</i>

00:08:07.988 --> 00:08:09.683
I know that, but...

00:08:10.924 --> 00:08:12.687
Do you feel sick
or something?

00:08:14.228 --> 00:08:16.560
It's just that if something
<i>did</i> happen,

00:08:17.097 --> 00:08:20.362
I figured that you would be
the one I could leave him to.

00:08:20.868 --> 00:08:24.929
Well, yeah, I'd...
I'd look out for him.

00:08:25.739 --> 00:08:28.173
That's good to hear.

00:08:28.742 --> 00:08:30.471
What brought this on?

00:08:31.144 --> 00:08:32.202
Toboe...

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:34.874
Thank you.

00:08:36.083 --> 00:08:37.175
You're acting weird.

00:08:38.051 --> 00:08:39.882
You're acting funny, Blue.

00:09:05.245 --> 00:09:08.271
This one can walk.
This one will walk with you.

00:09:52.759 --> 00:09:54.420
He's sound asleep,
that's all.

00:09:55.095 --> 00:09:57.154
You should get
some sleep, too.

00:09:58.065 --> 00:10:04.129
Of course, there's no telling if it's night
or day in a landscape like this.

00:10:05.405 --> 00:10:06.599
I'm scared.

00:10:08.709 --> 00:10:12.873
I don't know how Pops will react to us
when he wakes up and sees us.

00:10:14.982 --> 00:10:16.882
I'm sure that he doesn't have
any hard feelings anymore.

00:10:17.884 --> 00:10:20.717
You released him from the rage
that was consuming him.

00:10:27.327 --> 00:10:28.089
Pops!

00:10:29.596 --> 00:10:32.332
Where are you,
Blue...?

00:10:32.332 --> 00:10:35.460
Pops! I'm right here!
I'm right beside you!

00:10:36.436 --> 00:10:37.869
Blue...

00:10:40.841 --> 00:10:43.708
There you are...
There you are.

00:10:44.044 --> 00:10:45.602
Good girl...

00:10:47.614 --> 00:10:49.548
Who else is here?

00:10:49.883 --> 00:10:52.078
It's me.
Do you know who I am?

00:10:52.552 --> 00:10:55.715
Yeah. That's the voice
of the pretty-boy.

00:10:55.956 --> 00:10:57.116
Can't you see him?

00:10:57.591 --> 00:11:00.822
Just enough
to make out blurs.

00:11:02.796 --> 00:11:05.321
He's finally awake...
Isn't that great, Blue?

00:11:06.466 --> 00:11:07.558
Is that the kid?

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:13.100
There are more people here.
Lots more.

00:11:14.041 --> 00:11:15.406
I can sense them.

00:11:15.976 --> 00:11:16.943
That's right.

00:11:17.244 --> 00:11:19.872
Who... are you people?

00:11:20.414 --> 00:11:24.783
Pops, they're...
The thing is, they're...

00:11:25.385 --> 00:11:26.784
We're wolves.

00:11:31.324 --> 00:11:33.258
Yeah, right.
Gimme a break.

00:11:33.527 --> 00:11:36.928
It's the truth.
They're wolves.

00:11:37.431 --> 00:11:39.797
And the Flower Maiden
is with them.

00:11:40.901 --> 00:11:44.530
Cheza was the one
who resuscitated you.

00:11:45.405 --> 00:11:50.035
They brought you along because they
wanted to go to Paradise together.

00:11:50.677 --> 00:11:52.201
Paradise...?

00:12:00.587 --> 00:12:01.781
You shouldn't be
moving yet!

00:12:17.537 --> 00:12:18.799
Where are you going?

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:24.877
Go to Paradise together, huh?
Talk about a bad dream...

00:12:26.012 --> 00:12:29.812
If you're telling me that this is reality,
I'd rather be dead.

00:12:29.916 --> 00:12:34.546
Why are you being like this?! Do you have any
idea how worried Blue was about you?!

00:12:36.923 --> 00:12:40.894
I know you missed Blue, too!
I know you want to be with her!

00:12:40.894 --> 00:12:42.054
Shut up!

00:12:42.963 --> 00:12:46.797
Blue. You're not
my dog anymore.

00:12:47.868 --> 00:12:49.335
Pops...?

00:13:10.357 --> 00:13:11.324
Quent!

00:13:11.992 --> 00:13:14.051
How long have you been
working with the wolves?

00:13:14.394 --> 00:13:15.861
It's not like that!

00:13:16.563 --> 00:13:18.827
Weren't you looking
for your woman?

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:26.664
She's here with me.

00:13:30.043 --> 00:13:31.840
Don't you remember?

00:13:32.279 --> 00:13:34.907
She was the one who
found you and Blue.

00:13:36.883 --> 00:13:40.649
And after that, she...
She...

00:13:41.855 --> 00:13:46.155
Do you understand?! The whole world
is turning into a nightmare!

00:13:47.961 --> 00:13:50.191
There's nowhere
to run!

00:13:50.864 --> 00:13:54.459
You find your own
place to die.

00:13:56.503 --> 00:13:58.869
Every living thing
has that instinct.

00:13:59.206 --> 00:14:01.902
Stop being stubborn!
Come with...

00:14:05.846 --> 00:14:08.144
Don't say another
word to me.

00:14:08.748 --> 00:14:12.018
She's...
Blue is free now.

00:14:12.018 --> 00:14:13.144
Quent!

00:14:14.688 --> 00:14:17.054
Don't make me more miserable
than I already am.

00:14:32.806 --> 00:14:35.366
Hige. Where are you
planning on going?

00:14:37.944 --> 00:14:39.012
Where do you think?

00:14:39.012 --> 00:14:42.106
No matter where you go,
I'm going with you.

00:14:43.350 --> 00:14:44.510
Blue...

00:14:44.918 --> 00:14:46.749
Where you go,
I go.

00:14:48.388 --> 00:14:50.948
You don't intend to go
to Paradise, am I right?

00:14:52.626 --> 00:14:54.361
I'm going with you.

00:14:54.361 --> 00:14:57.130
What're you saying?
You're gonna go with...

00:14:57.130 --> 00:14:58.893
Didn't I just say that
I'm going with you?!

00:15:00.634 --> 00:15:04.331
I'm pretty sure I couldn't
get into Paradise, anyway.

00:15:04.671 --> 00:15:06.832
Because I'm not
pure wolf.

00:15:07.908 --> 00:15:09.933
Something tells me
that's what would happen.

00:15:10.277 --> 00:15:14.839
I was...
I was with Jaguara.

00:15:15.982 --> 00:15:18.576
There's no way that I could go to the
same world as Kiba and the others.

00:15:19.052 --> 00:15:20.153
So let's stay together!

00:15:20.153 --> 00:15:21.984
What about
your old man?

00:15:23.256 --> 00:15:25.918
Are you okay with him
splitting up with you?

00:15:26.393 --> 00:15:29.556
Are you okay with that <i>and</i>
not going to Paradise?

00:15:31.031 --> 00:15:33.932
If I'm with you, that's
enough for me, Hige.

00:15:35.535 --> 00:15:38.993
If I can be with you to the bitter end,
that's enough for me!

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:48.847
I saw
what I saw.

00:15:50.717 --> 00:15:52.844
That was no misunderstanding.

00:15:54.621 --> 00:16:01.026
Wolves were there, looking at me
like they were mocking me.

00:16:03.463 --> 00:16:07.524
There was a wolf there
with one eye that was gold.

00:16:13.807 --> 00:16:15.775
Kiba?
Do you feel that?

00:16:16.643 --> 00:16:18.042
That sound, it's...

00:16:18.445 --> 00:16:20.037
He's close by!

00:16:29.389 --> 00:16:30.356
What the...?!

00:16:43.837 --> 00:16:45.566
There is a sad voice.

00:16:46.506 --> 00:16:49.475
A great, sad pain.

00:16:50.043 --> 00:16:53.342
Was something hurt
by that light just now?

00:16:54.614 --> 00:16:57.174
Take this one there.

00:16:59.719 --> 00:17:01.687
Hige and the old guy
haven't come back yet!

00:17:02.655 --> 00:17:04.213
Kiba, stick close
to Cheza.

00:17:04.524 --> 00:17:06.082
I'll go find Hige
and Blue.

00:17:06.693 --> 00:17:08.461
You look for the
two old guys!

00:17:08.461 --> 00:17:09.428
Got it!

00:17:10.530 --> 00:17:12.088
You sensed it, too?

00:17:12.999 --> 00:17:19.802
He had probably planned to split up
with us since we reached Jaguara.

00:17:20.273 --> 00:17:22.833
No, probably since way before
he got his memory back.

00:17:23.443 --> 00:17:24.307
Yeah.

00:17:25.478 --> 00:17:26.945
I'm used to betrayal.

00:17:27.447 --> 00:17:29.642
Hige didn't betray us.

00:17:30.083 --> 00:17:31.345
I know that.

00:17:33.219 --> 00:17:37.679
But when it's all said and done,
he kept on fooling us to the very end.

00:17:40.126 --> 00:17:43.823
He kept his true intentions
hidden the whole time.

00:17:44.364 --> 00:17:46.594
But you and I knew.

00:17:48.201 --> 00:17:51.659
We knew it, even though he was
hiding it from us, right?

00:17:53.173 --> 00:17:54.231
Yeah.

00:17:55.642 --> 00:17:56.939
Hey!

00:17:58.244 --> 00:17:59.541
Hey!

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:02.175
Where is everybody?!

00:18:03.216 --> 00:18:04.547
Hey!

00:18:15.795 --> 00:18:17.888
Um... Where's Blue?

00:18:23.636 --> 00:18:25.501
You shouldn't move around
on your own.

00:18:26.106 --> 00:18:27.440
Come back
and join us.

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:31.240
If you want to laugh at how I live
my life, go ahead and laugh.

00:18:33.813 --> 00:18:37.772
That's the kind of stupid creatures
we humans are.

00:18:38.618 --> 00:18:41.212
We're not like
you dignified wolves.

00:18:42.088 --> 00:18:44.556
We gotta have something
to cling to.

00:18:45.058 --> 00:18:48.255
We gotta resent something.
Hate something.

00:18:48.495 --> 00:18:49.962
Envy something.

00:18:51.498 --> 00:18:53.728
We gotta love something.

00:18:57.103 --> 00:18:58.661
I like humans!

00:19:01.774 --> 00:19:02.775
Pops!

00:19:02.775 --> 00:19:04.504
Don't call me that!

00:19:26.032 --> 00:19:27.167
Is that him?

00:19:27.167 --> 00:19:28.156
Yeah.

00:19:47.353 --> 00:19:48.411
Who are...

00:19:49.022 --> 00:19:53.652
Unclean creatures are not
permitted to enter this land.

00:19:56.462 --> 00:20:00.796
I will not allow you
to proceed any further.

00:20:02.168 --> 00:20:06.400
I've seen that before.
I've seen your eye before.

00:20:07.674 --> 00:20:11.303
What the hell are you?
A human?

00:20:11.644 --> 00:20:13.669
Or are you
a wolf?

00:20:14.280 --> 00:20:16.475
I am neither.

00:20:17.383 --> 00:20:21.410
That eye of yours is a wolf's,
no two ways about it.

00:20:23.890 --> 00:20:27.849
When a human loses
something precious to him,

00:20:28.394 --> 00:20:30.954
he loses his soul
along with it.

00:20:31.631 --> 00:20:33.929
Do you know
what that's like?

00:20:35.134 --> 00:20:36.431
Indeed I do.

00:20:37.036 --> 00:20:41.666
You do whatever it takes to get revenge
on the person who took it from you.

00:20:42.008 --> 00:20:43.475
You show no mercy.

00:20:43.610 --> 00:20:46.170
Yes. I have no need
for mercy.

00:21:42.635 --> 00:21:45.604
Gunshot of Remorse

00:23:05.651 --> 00:23:06.652
Next Time
<i>  </i>
<i>  </i>
<i>  </i>

00:23:06.652 --> 00:23:07.653
Next Time
<i>  </i>
The way a man meets his end
is important.

00:23:07.653 --> 00:23:08.984
The way a man meets his end
is important.

00:23:09.322 --> 00:23:11.524
Anything'd be better
than dying in the gutter.

00:23:11.524 --> 00:23:13.617
Me, I wanna die
in my bed.

00:23:14.627 --> 00:23:16.129
It's gotten cold...

00:23:16.129 --> 00:23:19.758
Barkeep, make my dying drink a vodka.

00:23:22.758 --> 00:23:26.758
Preuzeto sa www.titlovi.com
